@startuml FR02_Logout_Sequence
title FR-02 / UC-02.2 - Log Out
autonumber
actor "Logged-in Staff Member" as Staff
boundary "Client" as Client
control "AuthController" as Ctrl
control "AuthService" as Svc
note over Staff, Svc
  Precondition: The user has a current session or token.
end note
Staff -> Client: Request logout
Client -> Ctrl: Submit logout request with current session/token
Ctrl -> Svc: Invalidate current session or token
Svc -> Svc: Invalidate current session or token
Svc --> Ctrl: Current session/token invalidated
Ctrl --> Client: Logout completed
Client --> Staff: Logout completed
@enduml